# ============================================================
#  Bhū Rise Ventures — website repo (PUBLIC)
#  Keep internal / private material OUT of the public repo.
#  Note: CNAME, .nojekyll, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, site.webmanifest
#  are intentionally TRACKED — they are part of the live site.
# ============================================================

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- Private / internal material (belt-and-suspenders) ---
# None of these exist in the repo today; this prevents accidentally
# publishing drafts, notes, or source material if ever placed here.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
/drafts/
/notes/
/internal/
/_private/
.env
.env.*

# Project notes & office/design source. The live site is .html/.css/.js,
# so these are never site assets. To publish one deliberately, force it:
#   git add -f <file>
*.md
!README.md
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.pptx
*.docx
*.pdf
*.psd
*.ai
*.sketch
*.fig

